    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρενο-γόνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>begetting</i> or
				<i>bearing male children,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				573b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				585b13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ σμικραὶ κοτυληδόνες ἀρς.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Steril.</u>
					230
				</span></i>
			; of drugs, <i>promoting the conception of males,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.140
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρενογόνον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλον</span>
			 III, <i>dog's mercury, Mercurialis perennis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.18.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				26.162
			</span></i>.</div>
